cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AI-GR, please cite both the working paper and this reference implementation."
type: software
title: "AI-GR — The Agentic Governance Ribbon"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the Agentic Governance Ribbon (AI-GR) framework
  and the Governance Provenance Record (GPR) specification. AI-GR is a
  provenance-first governance framework for agentic AI, organized as a five-
  lifecycle-gate by three-risk-tier matrix that produces a cryptographically
  attested, append-only audit ribbon mappable to seventeen regulatory regimes
  spanning AI-specific, sectoral, data-protection, cybersecurity, and
  platform-governance law.
